cord here runs 75 years back to 1951, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids January to February came in under 90% of normal in 35 of those years. In 2025 the middle of the grids had August to September at 31% of normal and March to April at 168%. So far in 2026, January to February sat at 50% on the middle of the grids. Grid 22965 had its driest year in 1976 at 60% of normal.</p>"}
